# UI rules

## Design system

- Colors and surfaces: CSS variables in `custom.css` (`--accent-primary`, `--accent-secondary`, `--card-bg`, etc.). Dark default; light via `html[data-theme="light"]`.
- Typography: Plus Jakarta Sans for headings, Inter for body (already wired in `custom.css`).
- Buttons: `btn-premium`, `btn-premium-outline`. Cards: `glass-card`, `project-card`, `cert-card`.
- Avoid new inline `style=` for colors; use utilities or new classes in `custom.css`.

## Layout

- Section spacing: `py-section`; alternate with `bg-light` where the plan uses banding.
- Section titles: `section-title` / `section-title-center`.
- Scroll offset: sections use `scroll-margin-top` (~85px) for fixed nav.

## Links and motion

- External links: `target="_blank"` and `rel="noopener noreferrer"`.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` (no hero canvas animation, no reveal transforms when set).
- Visible `:focus-visible` on interactive controls (nav, buttons, form fields).

## Resume page

- Do not edit `@media print` blocks in `resume.html` when changing marketing pages.
- Marketing homepage resume CTA = PDF download; `resume.html` = print/save PDF in browser.
